     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I will need to investigate the implications... but it also may be possible to skip the creation of the index in the case that a PID-list is provided by the user. It would be slower without the index, but with a small PID-list, not as slow as re-creating the index.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
