  "customfield_10187": null,
  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The migration-utils process currently creates a datastream index for all the datastreams in a Fedora 3 repository, regardless of the number of objects that will actually be migrated (as specified in the PID list).",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This can result in unnecessary processing time, especially for large repositories where only a small subset of objects will be migrated.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Proposed solution:  if a list of PIDs to be migrated is specified, only create a datastream index for the datastreams in the objects identified by those PIDs.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
