  "description": "<p>The migration-utils process currently creates a datastream index for all the datastreams in a Fedora 3 repository, regardless of the number of objects that will actually be migrated (as specified in the PID list).</p>\n\n<p>This can result in unnecessary processing time, especially for large repositories where only a small subset of objects will be migrated.</p>\n\n<p>Proposed solution:  if a list of PIDs to be migrated is specified, only create a datastream index for the datastreams in the objects identified by those PIDs.</p>",
